    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well-presented three-bedroom, three-bathroom mid-terrace home is ideally located in the highly sought-after Heather Hills development, within easy walking distance of Carlow town and a wide range of local amenities including shops, gyms, schools, and excellent commuting routes.\n\n\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious, and in good condition throughout. On entering the property, you are welcomed by a large entrance hallway with guest WC. To the front of the home is a comfortable living room featuring a gas fire and a large window, allowing for plenty of natural light.\n\nTo the rear, the property opens into a spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area, providing an ideal space for everyday family living and entertaining. A practical utility room is located just off the kitchen, offering additional storage and convenience.\n\n\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, all complete with fitted wardrobes. A well-appointed, fully tiled family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\n\nExternally, the property benefits from communal parking to the front, along with side access leading to the rear garden.\n\n\nHeather Hills remains one of Carlow`s most popular residential developments, thanks to its convenient location, strong local amenities, and easy access to the town centre and commuter routes. This is a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, families, or investors alike.\n\nHomes in this location are always in strong demand and this property is unlikely to remain on the market for long. Early viewing is highly recommended. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Sought after Heather Hills development - very popular with home owners </li><li> 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom configuration </li><li> Side access to rear garden </li><li> Gas heating - town supply </li><li> Generous room proportions throughout </li><li> Ample storage, utility room, fitted wardrobes in bedrooms </li><li> Great local access to shops, schools, gyms </li><li> Just off main commuting routes </li><li> Good condition throughout - ready to occupy.</li></ul>"
      },
